Verna, get on the fucking ground!

830
01:10:26,766 --> 01:10:28,060
Come here!

831
01:10:31,186 --> 01:10:32,855
Maybe I'm on a roll...

832
01:10:32,896 --> 01:10:34,899
...and I'll kill every damn Sawyer I see.

833
01:10:41,322 --> 01:10:43,492
Jed, Jed...

834
01:10:45,283 --> 01:10:49,497
<i>Jed... Are you okay down there?

835
01:10:52,165 --> 01:10:53,167
<i>Jed?

836
01:10:53,291 --> 01:10:54,794
<i>Come on, now.

837
01:10:58,840 --> 01:10:59,800
Hold on.

838
01:10:59,882 --> 01:11:02,509
Come on, we've got you. We've got you, Jed.

839
01:12:20,294 --> 01:12:23,507
This will hold it together while it heals...

840
01:12:25,800 --> 01:12:27,636
All right, you're going to feel this...

841
01:12:27,760 --> 01:12:29,260
I'm going to pull it pretty tight.

842
01:12:38,103 --> 01:12:39,397
All right...

843
01:12:45,401 --> 01:12:46,611
Jed...

844
01:13:20,518 --> 01:13:22,062
I'll help you.

845
01:13:24,230 --> 01:13:26,150
I swear.

846
01:13:28,233 --> 01:13:30,737
Untie me, please...

847
01:13:32,029 --> 01:13:33,406
Please...

848
01:13:34,323 --> 01:13:35,616
Why?

849
01:13:42,413 --> 01:13:44,709
What were you going to do to me?

850
01:13:47,295 --> 01:13:48,839
I don't know...

851
01:13:54,260 --> 01:13:58,221
I'm sorry, I am...

852
01:14:07,731 --> 01:14:09,485
Jesus Christ!

853
01:14:11,777 --> 01:14:13,196
Let's go...

854
01:14:24,916 --> 01:14:26,793
<i>Nubbins, come here.

855
01:14:38,763 --> 01:14:40,057
Bring your brother something to eat.

856
01:14:40,098 --> 01:14:41,348
All right.

857
01:14:47,895 --> 01:14:49,773
<i>They're gone! They're gone!

858
01:14:54,361 --> 01:14:55,988
Go, go...

859
01:15:03,494 --> 01:15:05,914
No!

860
01:15:05,997 --> 01:15:07,291
Leave her alone!

861
01:15:07,666 --> 01:15:09,085
No.

862
01:15:10,252 --> 01:15:12,170
Hurry, bring him.

863
01:15:21,345 --> 01:15:22,645
You messed with the wrong family!

864
01:15:22,680 --> 01:15:25,143
Yeah, you're proud of this damn family, aren't
you?

865
01:15:26,307 --> 01:15:27,351
Jed!

866
01:15:30,353 --> 01:15:31,731
Jed!

867
01:15:43,826 --> 01:15:45,704
Oh, fuck!

868
01:15:52,459 --> 01:15:54,754
What are you going to do?

869
01:16:05,472 --> 01:16:07,099
It's not over, boy!

870
01:16:07,349 --> 01:16:08,642
Goddamn it!

871
01:16:10,058 --> 01:16:11,852
This isn't over, damn it! You hear me?

872
01:16:11,934 --> 01:16:14,898
Jed, what have I told you about strangers?

873
01:16:15,064 --> 01:16:17,025
They fill your ears with lies...

874
01:16:17,066 --> 01:16:18,943
Show them who you are, Jed.

875
01:16:20,235 --> 01:16:22,739
Look what that man did to your face!

876
01:16:28,368 --> 01:16:29,953
Jackson, don't do it!

877
01:16:31,747 --> 01:16:33,416
No!

878
01:16:33,499 --> 01:16:35,543
Shut up. You're next, you hear me?

879
01:16:35,584 --> 01:16:36,544
Fuck you!

880
01:16:37,044 --> 01:16:38,672
No!

881
01:16:46,260 --> 01:16:47,471
No!

882
01:17:52,702 --> 01:17:54,120
Go, go, go! Get her now!

883
01:17:54,155 --> 01:17:54,997
Go get her!

884
01:17:56,539 --> 01:17:59,293
Jed, remember what I told you? Go get her.

885
01:17:59,500 --> 01:18:00,419
Get her, Jed!

886
01:18:01,753 --> 01:18:03,380
Nobody messes with our family!

887
01:19:52,193 --> 01:19:54,405
Help me!

888
01:19:57,615 --> 01:20:00,411
No!

889
01:20:19,012 --> 01:20:20,597
Jackson, don't do this!

890
01:20:21,930 --> 01:20:24,267
Please, don't do this!

891
01:20:25,392 --> 01:20:26,936
I tried to help you...

892
01:20:27,311 --> 01:20:29,105
That's all I ever tried to do.

893
01:20:29,355 --> 01:20:30,732
You know that, right?

894
01:20:31,440 --> 01:20:33,818
Listen to me, it's not too late...

895
01:20:34,276 --> 01:20:36,069
We can still get out of here together.

896
01:20:36,360 --> 01:20:38,112
That bitch is a liar, Jed!

897
01:20:38,695 --> 01:20:40,156
She doesn't care about you...

898
01:20:40,614 --> 01:20:42,368
Kill her! Kill her now!

899
01:20:42,408 --> 01:20:44,161
Please don't listen to her.

900
01:20:45,119 --> 01:20:46,538
Please.

901
01:20:46,996 --> 01:20:48,457
I know there's good in you...

902
01:20:48,915 --> 01:20:50,041
I've seen it.

903
01:20:50,707 --> 01:20:53,920
Please listen to me. This isn't you, Jackson!

904
01:20:55,170 --> 01:20:56,339
This isn't you!

905
01:20:56,880 --> 01:20:58,467
It's your crazy mother!

906
01:20:58,883 --> 01:21:00,010
It's her...

907
01:21:15,943 --> 01:21:17,487
That's my boy!

908
01:21:18,028 --> 01:21:19,737
You did good, Jed.

909
01:21:23,407 --> 01:21:25,368
You made your mama proud.

910
01:21:28,328 --> 01:21:32,084
<i>No!

911
01:23:54,096 --> 01:24:49,652
<i>Leatherface (2017)
Subtitles by TaMaBin
